Let me fix `_evaluate` to split the hand string by whitespace to get individual card tokens.

The fix is simple: in `_evaluate`, change `cards = [_parse_card(c) for c in hand]` to `cards = [_parse_card(c) for c in hand.split()]`.

Let me also double-check the rest of the logic:

